{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:40a84e02825d034610deb52c0330a1cd67b00ec0f2a1829b2c7f2f6e15372c32",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5958e802d61a4400a0c52fde005ddfc30f23411f932a170fb0265ebfde2a112e",
      "text": "下一个舞台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3065c5f56fe64fa760e1514850bff31f24b794e550ce1e04bb3b56c764e7e70",
      "text": "为缺钱所困的教师山下，某天收到了来自\n同僚硲和舞田的邀请，问他要不要一起去当偶像。\n听完两人充满激情与梦想的话语，\n山下的回答是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000009:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000009:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5958e802d61a4400a0c52fde005ddfc30f23411f932a170fb0265ebfde2a112e",
      "text": "下一个舞台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b00c79024b565de54a8d0cae36fe084709873a9da523b3aec02ac08dfb1c3050",
      "text": "唉～真没办法。\n运气真差啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fb7ed919af810dfb0e0ba6be693219c3c8de3e6229d436d1a5d968a61ebe6f3",
      "text": "（真没想到冰箱会坏掉呢。\n虽然顺利买新的换上了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7a6c5c2e5fc2ca88e2fed608fee6b4fe5f9fd8707db0dc703fbc5a38df70402",
      "text": "（意料之外的开销，大叔的钱包要告急喽。\n离发工资还有几天来着……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60cd6d28545674925378b0047f1b027b3149341d140dc235cc0c29aa51c41c9b",
      "text": "（必须想办法熬过去才行，\n不然特意买的新冰箱就毫无意义了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54998b0d67feb9e6c723f8d696c68eaff55e6e27d777b1aeb63fbdafa2ea99e6",
      "text": "有没有什么好办法呢……\n……哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45835127ab8256a3d59e6d63b4ce3f14827e8e0b0e25af7840aa011368446f51",
      "text": "（赛马直播吗。\n说起来今天确实有比赛来着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbf62793b44b03e30bd834c7692bfdf810f48fde31efbecf47a9f985e4d1b23e",
      "text": "（……等等。\n这种时候，要不要试着孤注一掷逆转一把？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9eca58a1cdea33d716daa2d14859f33d6e1b00dbc05793ac6f7d939ad5d87ee",
      "text": "（冰箱坏了的事，\n应该已经把霉运都用光了吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d26890499eddbdc1c467861119ce120be2814607369dc5d3291a42449210b1ab",
      "text": "（按顺序来说，接下来\n该轮到好事发生了才对吧！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1412f90da75f5752096e44a108933165e93d6c79a0296c1c2e039c972611049c",
      "text": "好，来试试运气吧！\n看起来势头正盛的马是……哇哦！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc01b712efc5238bb93bf2462c6df4bec4e751db4c40decb3bc4528a4dc99cb3",
      "text": "对、对不起！我赶时间！\n您没事吧！？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
